  The following files contain code derived from or substantially inspired
  by the cva source and have been modified from the original:

    packages/fold/src/fold.ts

  Key modifications include:
  - StringOrBoolean<T> replaces StringToBoolean<T> to preserve string
    literal variants alongside boolean
  - partition() function for typed prop splitting (new, not in cva)
  - .variantKeys and .config properties attached to every fold fn (new)
  - foldConfig() typed identity helper (new)
  - compose() returns an augmented function with .variantKeys, .configs,
    and .partition (extended from cva's plain function return)
  - onResolve hook replaces onComplete / cx:done
